cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, and cite the original publisher of any figure you use."
type: dataset
title: "Data Center Electricity Use"
abstract: >
  Published estimates of data center electricity use, each traced to its publisher: US totals and 2030
  scenarios from Lawrence Berkeley National Laboratory's 2025 Update, world totals and projections from
  the IEA, EU totals from the European Commission, Ireland from the Central Statistics Office, and the
  electricity Google, Microsoft and Meta report. Values copied exactly as published, with source URL,
  period and retrieval date for every row.
